<title>USA: Northside ISD, Texas, won by Fidelity Capital.</title>
<headline>Northside ISD, Texas, won by Fidelity Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Capital Mkts said it won $6.200 million of Northside ISD, Texas, public property finance limited tax contractual obligation, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.268 percent.</p>
</text>
